WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00.420 --> 00:04.450
Communication is a powerful tool in all aspects of our lives,

2
00:04.770 --> 00:08.770
especially in organisations focused on achieving substantial change.

3
00:09.160 --> 00:13.470
In this course, you’ll learn how to harness the power of effective communication

4
00:13.800 --> 00:17.090
to inspire action, both at work and at home.

5
00:18.020 --> 00:20.450
Meet Aaliyah, Noah and Maryam,

6
00:21.250 --> 00:24.670
all on their way to work at MODA, an international retailer.

7
00:25.320 --> 00:28.919
MODA is a market leader with locations on four continents

8
00:28.919 --> 00:32.770
and is about to embark on a five-year digital transformation.

9
00:33.250 --> 00:38.850
Aaliyah, the Chief Transformation Officer, will be leading the organisation in this journey.

10
00:39.330 --> 00:44.230
She’ll identify opportunities to create a standout in-store customer experience.

11
00:44.810 --> 00:48.712
Noah, the Head of Digital, will be collaborating with Aaliyah

12
00:48.712 --> 00:52.870
to identify and support new digital transformation opportunities.

13
00:53.540 --> 00:58.168
Maryam, Lead Analyst, will be working closely with Aaliyah and Noah

14
00:58.168 --> 01:01.760
to ensure the right data and insights are available.

15
01:02.530 --> 01:06.485
All three will work as a team to prepare for the transformation

16
01:06.485 --> 01:10.880
and discover new ways to achieve their individual communication goals.

17
01:11.620 --> 01:17.190
Throughout this experience, you’ll get the chance to learn more about Aaliyah, Noah and Maryam,

18
01:17.570 --> 01:20.770
and kick off your own communications journey along with them.

